=== Extended Text Plugin ===
Contributors: hughwillfayle
Donate Link: http://hughwillfayle.de
Tags: text, widget, extended text
Requires at least: 2.0.2
Tested up to: 3.0.4
Stable tag: 0.3

An extended text-widget which is able to exclude its display on defined pages.

== Installation ==

1. Upload `extended-text.php` to the `/wp-content/plugins/` directory
2. Activate the plugin through the 'Plugins' menu in WordPress

